{"id": null, "n": "0126006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0126006", "type": "mod", "text": "厄【大】，危【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0126007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0126007", "type": "mod", "text": "謎【CB】＊【麗-CB】＊【磧-CB】＊【宋】＊【元】＊【明】＊【宮】＊，䜝【大】＊"}
